Seika_Mossgrove_House1_Text_Npc0::
	.string "KAYA's family has kept our star\n"
	.string "shrine for a hundred years.\p"
	.string "The story goes that the first\n"
	.string "COMBEE queen hid the WISHING STAR\l"
	.string "from the storm, under her wings.$"
	.string "{JPN}{JPN}カヤの　いちぞくは　100ねん　この　むらの\n"
	.string "ほしの　やしろを　まもって　おる。\p"
	.string "いいつたえでは　はじめての　ミツハニーの\n"
	.string "じょおうが　あらしから　ねがいぼしを　はねの\l"
	.string "したに　かくしたそうじゃ。$"

Seika_Mossgrove_House1_EventScript_Npc1::
